  "firmware_note": "Debian userland with an ATTACKMODE system that reconfigures the USB gadget personality on the fly; payloads are bash extended with QUACK-prefixed DuckyScript. Bash Bunny (stock, Debian-based)",
  "vendor": "Hak5",
  "vendor_url": "https://hak5.org",
