   "mcu_secondary": "ESP32-WROOM-32E-N8",
   "mcu_secondary_note": "Dual-core Xtensa, 8MB flash. Holds the BLE GATT link to the phone app and stores Evil Portal HTML. Talks to the C5 over an internal UART. Espressif's ESP32 datasheet specifies Bluetooth v4.2 BR/EDR and LE for this part, not the 'BLE 5.0 + Classic' the vendor's spec table claims.",
