  "price_checked": "2026-09-10",
  "skill_level": "intermediate",
  "skill_note": "Requires manual code customization and Arduino IDE compilation before deployment - payloads aren't loaded from an SD card the way a USB Rubber Ducky's are, you edit and reflash source.",
