  "honest_take": "At $35 direct it's a cheap way to add CAN sniffing to a Flipper Zero you already own, but it is CAN 2.0B only via the MCP2515 - the vendor's own page warns it will not work on CAN-FD vehicles, an increasingly large share of the fleet since roughly 2020. If you need CAN-FD or isolation, this isn't it - look at panda ($99, CAN-FD on 3 buses) or CANable Pro (isolated) instead; this addon's value is convenience (reusing a Flipper you already have), not raw capability. Also worth knowing: three different resellers list this as three apparently different products at three different prices ($35 Electronic Cats direct / $55 Hacker Warehouse / ~$42 Lab401) - they are the same board, and one first-pass automated scan flagged the Lab401 listing as a possible duplicate of an unrelated nRF24L01+ Flipper module (a 2.4GHz radio addon) rather than of these other two CAN listings; that flag was a false positive on the wrong pair - the real duplication is among these three CAN resellers, which this record merges into one.",
