  "firmware_note": "Official companion Flipper Application Package (FAP), open source (GPL-3.0), runs on stock Flipper Zero firmware and is listed in Flipper's official app catalog. All signal processing (ring buffers, statistical analysis, frequency detection) runs on the Flipper's own STM32WB55, not on the DigiLab module itself. Lab401 DigiLab companion app (401/DigiLab FAP)",
  "vendor": "Lab401 (hardware design by tixlegeek)",
  "vendor_url": "https://lab401.com",
