   "mcu_primary": null,
   "mcu_primary_note": "No separate MCU on the DigiLab board itself - all signal processing runs on the host Flipper Zero's STM32WB55. The board carries analog front-end/conditioning circuitry plus an onboard I2C EEPROM (board silkscreen designator U6; exact part number not published) used to demo the I2C Probe tool out of the box.",
