  "price_checked": "2026-09-10",
  "skill_level": "intermediate",
  "skill_note": "Flashing the firmware onto an ST-Link clone or blue pill is a documented, well-trodden process, but you are working with unbranded clone hardware and a project whose own author calls the JTAG implementation imperfect.",
