  "price_note": "Does not include a battery, antennas (beyond the GPS antenna), or a PN532 NFC reader - the listing states the PN532 'is no longer included' and specifically asks buyers not to contact support about it. A paid build service (Zeek Sec Labs, $60-100, paid separately) is offered for buyers who don't want to assemble it themselves.",
