  "firmware_repo": "https://github.com/epic-erebus",
  "firmware_note": "Ships intended to run a default open-source ECP5 bitstream for standalone memory acquisition and patch/match, but the entire pitch is that gateware, firmware and toolchain are open so you build/modify your own rather than run one fixed vendor image. As of the check date the linked GitHub org (github.com/epic-erebus) is a placeholder with no published source. Open PCILeech-compatible gateware (vendor default bitstream)",
  "vendor": "SecuringHardware.com",
