  "firmware_note": "Two separate stock ESP32Marauder builds - one on the handheld unit's own MCU, one on the Flipper-driven ESP32-C5 module - rather than one firmware coordinating both radios. No dedicated 'Double Barrel' firmware fork was found; this appears to be a hardware bundle of two standard Marauder targets, not custom firmware engineering. ESP32 Marauder (x2, independent instances)",
