  "price_note": "In stock at Hacker Warehouse (Add to Cart shown, no out-of-stock messaging), SKU 'OSL-ESP32' - the SKU prefix and matching product name/photos strongly indicate this is OpenSourceSDRLab's board being resold. OpenSourceSDRLab sells the same 'ESP32 Extension Board... MDK for H4M' directly for $35 on sale / $55 regular price; Hacker Warehouse's $45 sits in between.",
