  "firmware_note": "An Arduino sketch for the ESP8266 that logs, replays and injects Wiegand bitstreams, served through a built-in web UI over its own Wi-Fi AP or as a client on your network. GPL-2.0. Last commit January 2022.",
  "vendor": "Octosavvi (sold via Red Team Tools)",
