  "firmware_note": "No official firmware exists for this specific board. Owners flash Marauder to the ESP32-S2 and use the Flipper's own Sub-GHz and GPS support for the rest. ESP32 Marauder on the ESP32; sub-GHz and GPS driven by Flipper firmware",
