  "honest_take": "Be careful with this one. There is no vendor: 'Predator' is a name that appears on marketplace listings and in a couple of hobbyist GitHub notebooks, not a product line with a company, documentation or support behind it. The public notes that exist are honest about how little is known - one owner's repo openly lists 'which GPIO the display actually uses' and 'whether the A07 is just an RF front end or needs its own firmware' as open questions. Separately, the 'Predator Security Suite' Flipper app that shares the name is a software project with single-digit stars whose README leads with claims about supporting 35 car manufacturers and 18 frequencies; treat that as marketing, not as evidence the hardware opens cars. If you want this class of board, buy the documented equivalents instead.",
