  "firmware_note": "Every protocol is an 'applet' that builds fresh FPGA gateware on demand - which is why it can do timing-critical things a microcontroller-based adapter cannot. Stock (Glasgow applets and gateware)",
  "vendor": "1BitSquared (manufacture); designed by Catherine 'whitequark'",
  "vendor_url": "https://glasgow-embedded.org",
  "product_url": "https://1bitsquared.com/products/glasgow",
