  "price_note": "Last known price, on Tindie, where it has been sold out since 2023-01-04. KSEC listed it at GBP144.99, also out of stock. Electronic Cats have removed it from their store entirely - a store search returns no results, and the old product URL now serves the BomberCat page. The vendor states plainly: 'The Hunter Cat NFC is retired, and BomberCat is its successor.' BomberCat is US$119 and in stock.",
