  "firmware_repo": "https://github.com/lab-401/icopy-x",
  "firmware_note": "A clean-room rebuild - 'not built on the original author's IP, all code written from scratch' - that removes the factory tag DRM, runs the current Iceman Proxmark firmware, and adds a JSON-driven plugin system, USB screen mirroring and an ICS Decoder bridge for SEOS PACS extraction. Licence forbids commercial use.",
  "vendor": "iCopy-X (hardware) / lab-401 (firmware)",
