  "firmware_repo": "https://github.com/7h30th3r0n3/Evil-M5Project",
  "firmware_note": "The Cardputer build is the flagship and by a wide margin the most complete - the AtomS3, Core2, CoreS3 and NanoC6 builds drop Evil-Twin, Auto Deauther, SSH, BadUSB, handshake checking and more. Versions live in the .ino filename (currently v1.5.5); the repo publishes no GitHub releases or tags. Evil-M5Project (Evil-Cardputer)",
  "vendor": "M5Stack",
