     "note": "Silicon Labs EZRadioPRO. Datasheet range is 142-1050MHz continuous, up to +20dBm, -124dBm sensitivity, with OOK, 2-FSK, GFSK and CW. The M1's own firmware README scopes the device to 315-915MHz, which is what the antenna and matching network actually support. Note the sheet's '119-1050MHz' is the range of other Si446x parts, not the Si4463."
