  "firmware_repo": "https://github.com/RoganDawes/P4wnP1_aloa",
  "firmware_note": "A full Raspbian-based image, not an app you install. Original author MaMe82 stopped; RoganDawes took over the repo, and its last code push was October 2023. P4wnP1 A.L.O.A. (RoganDawes fork)",
  "vendor": "Community project (MaMe82 originally, RoganDawes now)",
  "vendor_url": "https://p4wnp1.readthedocs.io/",
