  "firmware_note": "Adds a full web UI, three payload slots, a JAIL network mode and a DYNAMICPROXY stream interceptor over the original's switch-and-SSH workflow. Packet Squirrel 4.x (stock, OpenWrt-based)",
  "vendor": "Hak5",
