  "price_note": "$150 standalone; Pro Bundle $160 (adds Payload Studio Pro), Elite Bundle $180. A TAA-compliant 'Packet Squirrel Advanced' SKU lists at $849.99 for government procurement. B2B/education SKU $120.",
  "price_is_estimate": false,
