  "firmware_note": "Original ESP-IDF v6.1 firmware with its own kernel/module/application architecture - not a fork of Bruce, ESP32 Marauder or Ghost ESP. Very actively developed, but no releases have ever been cut and the repository carries no licence file.",
  "vendor": "Stellar IoT",
