  "firmware_note": "OpenWrt with Aircrack-ng, MDK4, Kismet, nmap, bash and Python 3 preinstalled; payloads are loaded from an ordinary USB flash drive. Signal Owl 1.0.1 (stock, OpenWrt-based)",
