  "firmware_repo": "https://github.com/mwgroup-io/Doppelganger_Core",
  "firmware_note": "Runs a variant of PPE's Doppelganger_Core ESP32-S3 firmware (the same firmware family as the standalone 'Doppelganger Core' dev board already in this database), pre-flashed and pre-wired inside a commercial reader shell. It decodes Wiegand output from the host reader and pushes captured credentials to the phone-based 'Doppelganger Assistant' UI; deeper card-format coverage (MIFARE, Corporate 1000, etc.) sits behind paid firmware tiers exactly as it does on the bare Core board. Doppelgänger (Core/Pro tier, pre-installed)",
