  "firmware_repo": "https://github.com/jkramarz/TheTick",
  "firmware_note": "GPL-3.0 ESP32-C3 firmware that began as an ESPKey port and grew Wiegand, magstripe clock-and-data and partial OSDP support with both BLE and Wi-Fi interfaces.",
  "vendor": "Open-source project (PCBs via PCBWay community, or self-fabricated)",
